WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Master, please help me move into this truck directly.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,040
I'll add the shipping fee to you

3
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,960
Okay, there's a lot of stuff. I'll ask someone to move it together.

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,500
It turns out that moving things for a year takes a lot of energy.

5
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,180
Three sets is the limit. You can’t hold it hard.

6
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,460
One floor for staple food and one floor for barbecue

7
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,820
Milk tea and desserts are placed separately

8
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,860
You can find what you want to eat in the future at a glance

9
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,100
This is called hoarding

10
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,750
Xiao Shen, your unit doesn’t take a break on weekends either.

11
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:45,550
Lots of activity recently

12
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,350
Thank you for your hard work, please continue to make the same amount as before.
